<td id="A3.T10.3.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A3.T10.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">VQA (v2.0) Acc. (%)</span></td></tr>
